{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23303","headline":"内道场永讙上人就郡见访善说维摩经临别请诗因以此赠 · 白居易","name":"内道场永讙上人就郡见访善说维摩经临别请诗因以此赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五夏登坛内殿师，水爲心地玉爲仪。\n正传金粟如来偈，何用钱唐太守诗。\n苦海出来应有路，灵山别後可无期。\n他生莫忘今朝会，虚白亭中法乐时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23303.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23303","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}